This '''star''' was [[orbit]]ed by the [[planet]] [[Alderaan]],<ref name="Complete Locations" /> before the planet's [[Destruction of Alderaan|destruction]]<ref name="A New Hope">{{Film|IV}}</ref> in [[1 BBY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas: Updated Edition]]''</ref> When the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]] arrived in the [[Alderaan system|system]] to [[Destruction of Alderaan|destroy]] Alderaan, its massive shape [[eclipse]]d the [[Star|sun]], which was witnessed by [[Alderaanian monarchy|Queen]] [[Breha Organa]] and her [[Marriage|husband]], [[Viceroy]] [[Bail Prestor Organa|Bail Organa]]. From this, they realized that [[death]] was moments away.<ref name="Eclipse">{{StoryCite|story=Eclipse (short story)|book=From a Certain Point of View}}</ref>

